      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "移除快捷键"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click the sides to turn pages; click the center to show controls. Double-click a page to preview its image. Dragging does not move the page.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点击两侧翻页，点击中央显示操作栏。双击页面可预览图片，拖动不会移动页面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A / D: pages · Space: a screen · Q: controls · T: thumbnails · F: overview · R: reading settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A／D：翻页 · 空格：滚动一屏 · Q：操作栏 · T：缩略图 · F：总览 · R：阅读设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A / D and arrow keys navigate pages. Space scrolls a screen in continuous mode. Q shows controls, T opens thumbnails, F opens the page overview.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A／D 和方向键用于翻页，连续模式下空格滚动一屏。Q 显示操作栏，T 打开缩略图，F 打开页面总览。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The center area toggles controls. Double-click an image to preview it. Scroll a zoomed page to its edge, then start a new gesture to turn the page.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点击中央切换操作栏，双击图片打开预览。放大页面滚动到边缘后，重新开始一次滚动手势即可翻页。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add multiple shortcuts to an action, or remove them to leave it unbound. Escape cancels recording.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个操作可添加多个快捷键，也可移除全部绑定。Esc 取消录入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "eHunter-style keys: A / D navigate pages, Q toggles controls, T toggles thumbnails, F opens the page overview. Standard macOS shortcuts are preserved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "eHunter 风格快捷键：A／D 翻页，Q 切换操作栏，T 切换缩略图，F 打开页面总览。保留标准 macOS 快捷键。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This key combination is reserved for standard macOS navigation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此组合键保留用于标准 macOS 导航。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
